			"notes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to **Cozy Cherry Fields** are documented here.\n\nFormat based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/).\n\n## [0.0.1] — 2026-07-10\n\n### Added\n\n- Initial release for Minecraft 1.21.1, 1.21.6, and 1.21.11 (NeoForge)\n- Automatic Cherry Grove single-biome preset on world creation\n- Default seed `cozy`, bonus chest, and cozy game rules on new worlds\n- Unlock all recipes in the recipe book on player login\n\n### Notes\n\n- 1.21.11 uses the new gamerule registry API (`keep_inventory`, etc.)\n- 1.21.6+ uses updated registry lookup for world preset configuration"
		}
